Z||000015||kevin||10-20-2001||06:08 PM||||The cleanest most appealing scoop is adapting an early 73 to 75 Vette scoop found just in back of the front wheel. It provides abundant air while blending with the overall Fiero styling. Anyone doing one of these adaptations? ||||reg||1
